## chart primary-flows DogSwipe Primary Flows
```mermaid
flowchart TD
  eater["Hungry neighbor"]:::gray
  buy["GREEN buy credits 1:1 at par (POST /credits/purchase)"]:::green
  discover["GREEN discover offerings ranked by crave/distance (GET /discovery)"]:::green
  swipe["GREEN swipe like/pass/super-like (POST /swipes)"]:::green
  match["GREEN matches with live distance/walk (GET /matches)"]:::green
  claim["GREEN claim spends credits atomically (POST /orders, /orders/{id}/claim)"]:::green
  handoff["GREEN mutual hand-off confirmation settles credits to maker"]:::green
  review["GREEN two-way review after completed hand-off (POST /reviews)"]:::green
  auth["YELLOW SPAPS magic-link auth — device smoke bead pf5.8 BLOCKED"]:::yellow
  maker["GREEN maker submits/revises offerings (POST /vendor/submissions)"]:::green
  admin["GREEN admin approve/reject/edit + dispute resolve"]:::green
  eater --> buy --> discover --> swipe --> match --> claim --> handoff --> review
  eater --> auth
  maker --> admin --> discover
  classDef green fill:#dff7df,stroke:#20833a,stroke-width:2px,color:#0f2f18
  classDef yellow fill:#fff3bf,stroke:#b7791f,stroke-width:2px,color:#3a2a00
  classDef gray fill:#eef2f7,stroke:#64748b,stroke-width:1px,color:#111827
```

## chart lifecycle DogSwipe Order State Machine
```mermaid
stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> draft: POST /orders (snapshot offering + add-ons + total)
  draft --> claimed: POST /orders/{id}/claim (spend credits)
  claimed --> ready: POST /orders/{id}/confirm-ready (maker)
  ready --> handed_off: mutual confirm-hand-off (maker + claimer)
  handed_off --> completed: hand-off settled, credits to maker
  completed --> reviewed: POST /reviews (two-way, gated)
  reviewed --> [*]
  claimed --> disputed: POST /orders/{id}/dispute
  handed_off --> disputed: POST /orders/{id}/dispute
  disputed --> refunded_credit: admin resolve-dispute (refund credits, never cash)
  refunded_credit --> [*]
  draft --> canceled
  canceled --> [*]
```

